  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.body.places-of-lebanon": "黎巴嫩的地点",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.bkerke-seat-of-the-maron.bkerke-seat-of-the-maronite-patriarchate": "布凯尔凯：马龙尼宗主教座所在地",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.bkerke-seat-of-the-maron.bkerke-is-the-seat-of-the-maronite-patriarchate-a-hillside-v": "布凯尔凯是马龙尼宗主教座所在地，位于黎巴嫩朱尼耶区、靠近哈里萨的山坡村庄。马龙尼宗主教自19世纪起在此冬居。圣夏尔贝勒于1859年7月23日在布凯尔凯晋铎。",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.bkerke-seat-of-the-maron.charbel-s-life": "夏尔贝勒的生平",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.bkerke-seat-of-the-maron.plan-a-pilgrimage": "规划朝圣之旅",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.bkerke-seat-of-the-maron.qannoubine-monastery": "坎努宾修道院",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.what-bkerke-is.what-bkerke-is": "布凯尔凯是什么",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.what-bkerke-is.bkerke-also-written-bkerk-or-bkirki-is-a-village-in-the-dist": "布凯尔凯（Bkerke，也写作Bkerké或Bkirki）是朱尼耶区的一座村庄，是全东方马龙尼宗主教座所在地，也是马龙尼宗主教的冬季住所。根据教宗良十四世官方访问网站，它是安提约基雅之后马龙尼宗主教座的第十处所在地。它位于",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.what-bkerke-is.harissa": "哈里萨",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.what-bkerke-is.home-of-the-great-shrine-of-our-lady-of-lebanon": "下方的山坡，哈里萨是宏伟黎巴嫩圣母圣地所在地。",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.how-bkerke-became-the-se.how-bkerke-became-the-seat": "布凯尔凯如何成为宗主教座",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.how-bkerke-became-the-se.sheikh-khattar-el-khazen-built-a-monastery-at-bkerke-in-1703": "谢赫哈塔尔·哈津（Khattar el-Khazen）于1703年在布凯尔凯兴建修道院。它历经数次转手，1779年的宗座诏书将其指定为马龙尼团体的福祉服务。马龙尼会议将它视为卡迪沙谷坎努宾宗主教座的附属。1823年，它成为冬季宗主教座。",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.how-bkerke-became-the-se.sources-differ-on-the-date-of-the-move-another-history-place": "来源对迁移日期有分歧：另一份历史记述将法令定于1790年，实际执行定于1830年，在若瑟·胡拜什宗主教任内。",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.how-bkerke-became-the-se.the-building-has-grown-over-time-patriarch-jean-el-hajj-reno": "建筑随时间扩展。若望·哈吉宗主教于1890年翻修，增加上层。保禄·梅乌希宗主教于1970年修复；纳斯拉拉·斯费尔宗主教于1995年增建一翼，用于宗主教座档案与博物馆，并设宗主教墓及教堂彩色玻璃。",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.summer-in-dimane-winter.summer-in-dimane-winter-in-bkerke": "夏居迪马内，冬居布凯尔凯",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.summer-in-dimane-winter.the-patriarchs-of-bkerke-have-moved-between-two-residences-d": "布凯尔凯的宗主教在两处住所之间迁居：夏季住迪马内，冬季住布凯尔凯。布凯尔凯成为宗主教座之前，马龙尼会议将其修道院视为位于",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.summer-in-dimane-winter.qadisha-valley": "卡迪沙谷",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.summer-in-dimane-winter.see-the": "的坎努宾宗主教座的附属。另见",
