  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.accessibility.the-maronite-patriarch-s-summer-residence-at-dimane-a-long-s": "迪马内马龙尼宗主教夏季住所，一座长石砌建筑，有钟楼，前方有香柏树",
  "bkerke-maronite-patriarchate.summer-in-dimane-winter.the-patriarchs-summer-residence-at-dimane-photograph-xtcride": "迪马内的宗主教夏季住所。摄影：Xtcrider，",
